flowchart TB
    accTitle: Proposed design limited to three reliability priorities
    accDescr: Priority one keeps accepted events replayable until an immutable result and delivery intent are stored and the existing search-index prerequisite is satisfied. Priority two bounds enrichment and delivery concurrency, separates delivery retries from processing, and retains exhausted work for recovery. Priority three uses stable delivery identities, leased attempts, conditional status updates and a recipient deduplication contract. A durable dispatcher claims ready intents directly; there is no separate delivery broker or asynchronous search projection in this scope.
    ingress[Existing gateway and ingestion] -->|P1: accept only after durable append| bus[(Durable event buffer)]
    bus -->|Retain replay ownership until ready or needs attention| processing[Processing: resume by tenant and event ID]
    processing <-->|P2: assumed synchronous call, deadline and concurrency bound| enrichment[Enrichment service with circuit breaker]
    processing -->|P1: atomic immutable result and waiting-index intent| store[(Event state and durable delivery intents)]
    processing -->|Retained prerequisite: idempotent write| index[(Existing search index)]
    index -->|Write acknowledgment required| gate[Processing: mark intent ready durably, then acknowledge input]
    gate --> store
    store -->|P1: claim due ready work with lease and token| delivery[Delivery dispatcher: P2 tenant and endpoint limits]
    delivery -->|P3: stable key and immutable payload| endpoint[Customer endpoint: deduplication contract]
    endpoint -.->|Acceptance, rejection or ambiguous response loss| delivery
    delivery -->|P1 and P3: conditional outcome and next action commit| store
    store -.->|P2: retry due after backoff and jitter| delivery
    store -->|P1 and P2: expired leases, stale waiting work, exhausted budgets| recovery[Recovery owner: reconcile, retain needs-attention work]
    recovery -->|Resume due delivery or retain for attention| store
    recovery -.->|Resume stale indexing from saved result| processing
    store -->|P3: authoritative per-delivery status| dashboard[Existing dashboard and API]
    index -->|Existing event search, consistency unchanged| dashboard
